  "content": "<p>本<strong>非官方</strong>兼容补丁确保来自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-modlist-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Better ModList</strong></a>和<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a></strong>模组的纹理与<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/excalibur\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Excalibur</strong></a>资源包完美融合。</p><p><strong>特性：</strong></p><ul>\n<li>重新设计了<strong>Better ModList</strong>和<strong>Mod Menu</strong>模组的按钮。</li>\n</ul><p>为获得最佳体验，请配合<strong>Excalibur</strong>资源包使用本补丁。</p><p><strong>特别感谢：</strong></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/maffhew/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Maffhew</strong></a>——<strong>Excalibur</strong>资源包的作者。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/1foxy2/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>1Foxy2</strong></a>——<strong>Better ModList</strong>模组的作者。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/Prospector/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Prospector</strong></a>——<strong>Mod Menu</strong>模组的作者。</li>\n</ul><p>如果你喜欢这个兼容补丁，欢迎分享给更多人！</p>",
